674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EDCaEY0ve8oQ7kNvwF5qDfv&_nc_oc=AdrJDHm3-elgXBXkTzvkaquD6MY7XgoZFBf7A84fX8YAtOPUNFA1ZYv-VcJhx8FoJbk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFgGpJYSjkc8pU1jStlKJEZWvpR7hAuE5mzaF22RYtWHQ&oe=6A82E319"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w6S7JNb2ATYQ7kNvwGg-uUN&_nc_oc=Adr_0saW0A6SEzVA_9lO28kwAmkBwGHkUWLOIOV5nMRAq2DZL5o52lUdaZEe2GOIO20&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGGGUNuDoOcTgovRNT3WsaDNH_REBX-u16wLjyZdy-_Ng&oe=6A82EBD6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YEAAis-4-QsQ7kNvwHP8rlY&_nc_oc=AdqL6CUPOp5Vj4L1CmGTEEponsqIChSwjmAC78PWyW-7ZJPMNEVDnIDLz2bCuE1jNUQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF6eYHdE5YXwze261lQsIgefmJv1vaQQ2tt_x-B0xtRPQ&oe=6A82E7F1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip